king the anterior margin and a short stitch marking the superior margin  Specimen is oriented along the superior inferior axis and inked as follows  Anterior blue  posterior black  medial green  lateral yellow  Serial sectioning shows the previous biopsy site with a firm  ill defined stellate mass measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm within a dense area of fibrous tissue  The mass is located 0 5cm from the superior tip and 0 5cm from the inferior tip  it abuts the posterior margin and is 0 3cm from the lateral margin  0 7cm from the medial margin  and  1 0cm from the anterior margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Superior tip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Inferior tip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tumor  almost entirely submitted    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of area away from biopsy site  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  final superior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fibrofatty soft tissue fragment with a stitch marking the new margin  This is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  final medial   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fibrofatty soft tissue fragment with a stitch marking the final margin  This is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  final deep   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fibrofatty soft tissue fragment with a stitch marking the final margin  This is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  final inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm fibrofatty soft tissue fragment with a stitch on the new margin  This is inked black  