ogesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  02 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 08 07 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  Right breast lower lesion   are 3 cores of soft  tan tissue  ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE X 1 0cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE X 0 1cm which are submitted in toto as A  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  Right breast  upper lesion   are 4 cores of soft  tan tissue  ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE X 0 1cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE X 0 1cm which are submitted in toto as B  Gross Description by  Joe Serra Resident  ALEXANDER KRATZ  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Daniel Benjamin Kopans  M D  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST   LOWER LESION   CORE BIOPSY PART B  RIGHT BREAST   UPPER LESION   CORE BIOPSY   report_end  , Negative.
