with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 95 at 17 01 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast  is a 333 gram  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm right mastectomy specimen  which includes a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm right axillary tail  and which is partially covered by a REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm skin ellipse  The specimen is oriented with lateral and superior stitches  The skin ellipse includes a REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm areolar with a 3 5cm in length well healed scar that curves along the superior aspect of the areolar  The skin is diffusely tan white and otherwise unremarkable  The deep resection margin is a smooth plane  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a prior REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm cystic biopsy cavity lined by red tan grumose material  and surrounded by a rim of intense fibrosis and semi firm  sulphur yellow discoloration  The biopsy site is 1 0cm subjacent to the epidermal scar  and approaches to within 1 6cm of the deep inked margin  2 0cm of the superior margin  4 0cm of the inferior margin  4 5cm of the lateral margin  and 4 5cm of the medial margin  An extensive and poorly delineated REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm diffuse sheet of firm  gritty  bulging  tan white tissue encroaches upon the biopsy cavity  and extends to within 0 1cm of the deep inked margin  0 1cm of the inferior margin  1 3cm of the superior margin  2 0cm of the lateral margin  and 2 0cm of the medial margin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma consists of mature  lobular  yellow  adipose tissue with intercalating fibrous bands  The axillary tail is explored for lymph nodes  twenty three nodes are identified  Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right axillary breast node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm piece of fibroadipose tissue containing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm lymph node  The tissue is submitted in S  Summary section  AandB  Biopsy cavity and deep inked margin CandD  Biopsy cavity and skin E  Deep inked margin F H  Inferior margin I K  Superior margin L  Lateral margin M  Medial margin N  Nipple O S  Lymph nodes  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT  PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA    report_end  , Positive.
